{"id":"n34404-2-3","stage":4,"title":"극 · 极","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n34404-2-3-1","ko":"어? 전지를 넣었는데도 라디오가 안 나오네. 고장이 났나?","zh":"咦？明明已经插上电池了，收音机还是没声音。是出故障了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어?","meaning":"咦","explanation":"어：咦","readings":[{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26153","senseId":"1","lemma":"어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}},{"text":"전지를","meaning":"电池","explanation":"전지：电池；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전지","audio":"/audio/1c04da4f21beac27e3c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:전지:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"전지","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전지를","audio":"/audio/4272eff7eb694c3f1219.mp3"}},{"text":"넣었는데도","meaning":"开，打开","explanation":"넣다：开，打开；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"6","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣었는데도","audio":"/audio/811dac7d0378cee01f3f.mp3"}},{"text":"라디오가","meaning":"收音机","explanation":"라디오：收音机；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"라디오","audio":"/audio/6314a358f4e72c51b9cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66029","senseId":"2","lemma":"라디오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"라디오가","audio":"/audio/eb22b4bb4fed575cd5eb.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"나오네.","meaning":"出来，播放出来","explanation":"나오다：出来，播放出来；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"22","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오네","audio":"/audio/748c0c58eb06e4bfb20d.mp3"}},{"text":"고장이","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고장이","audio":"/audio/b777041e44a983a52170.mp3"}},{"text":"났나?","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났나","audio":"/audio/6e7a0560e5bf4d0feffb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"228794e2524374dc","term":"어","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3","entryId":"26153","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어"]},{"id":"1c04da4f21beac27","term":"전지","zh":"电池","audio":"/audio/1c04da4f21beac27e3c9.mp3","definition":"把化学能等转成电能的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"开，打开","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"给机器等连接动力，使其启动起来。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"6314a358f4e72c51","term":"라디오","zh":"收音机","audio":"/audio/6314a358f4e72c51b9cc.mp3","entryId":"66029","definition":"可以接收广播局发送的电波并把电波转换为音声的机械装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出来，播放出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"可以听到或看到广播电视节目。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"a1a759c684921a8d","term":"고장","zh":"故障","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3","entryId":"18856","definition":"机器或装置等不能正常运行。","pronunciation":["고ː장"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/275435f8a748f1fc727e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n34404-2-3-2","ko":"극을 잘못 끼운 거 아냐?","zh":"是不是电池装反了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"극을","meaning":"极，电极","explanation":"극：极，电极；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"극","audio":"/audio/fcc84a2b7b08100e1cae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34404","senseId":"2","lemma":"극","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"극을","audio":"/audio/e7b73dc8e667835f42ab.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못","meaning":"错","explanation":"잘못：错","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62478","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}},{"text":"끼운","meaning":"插，夹，掖","explanation":"끼우다：插，夹，掖；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"끼우다","audio":"/audio/2e5e463dcd04fed871e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28299","senseId":"1","lemma":"끼우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끼운","audio":"/audio/d4fade9ee34e09d9dd2e.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"아냐?","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아냐","audio":"/audio/775fa206224d591e4b76.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fcc84a2b7b08100e","term":"극","zh":"极，电极","audio":"/audio/fcc84a2b7b08100e1cae.mp3","entryId":"34404","definition":"电池上电流流动的两端。","pronunciation":["극"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못